  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The change in collector current for the given transistor can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>11</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The change in base&nbsp;current for the given transistor can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the current gain in CE configuration is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (1) to calculate the required quantity.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>110</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
